# Cargo
# Cargo.lock IS committed. The contract is a deployable artifact, so its build
# must be reproducible, and soroban-env-host declares `ed25519-dalek = ">=2.0.0"`
# — an unbounded range. Without a committed lock, CI re-resolves to the newest
# major (3.x), which does not compile against env-host, and the Rust job breaks
# with no change to this repo.
